=== mlk-3: offline_fs_scalar: per-customer CTE (20000 groups), scalar reduce over the CTE ===
idle level before the first execution: QUERY_MEMORY and TRANSACTION_MEMORY recorded on all 4 data nodes
reference run: 1 execution(s) via RDRS, every result identical to the reference
warm-up: 16 execution(s) via RDRS, 8 concurrent clients, every 200 response identical to the reference
first use: QUERY_MEMORY and TRANSACTION_MEMORY within the first-use allowance on all 4 data nodes
== Query ==
WITH cust_features AS (
SELECT lg_cust AS k, COUNT(*) AS cnt, SUM(lg_amount) AS spend
FROM lg_orders GROUP BY lg_cust)
SELECT COUNT(*), SUM(cust_features.cnt), MAX(cust_features.spend), MIN(cust_features.spend)
FROM cust_features;

